    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a galactic adventure in this thrilling space-mining simulator! Returning home from your interstellar travels, you stumble upon a mining station that presents the perfect opportunity to upgrade your outdated spaceship. Take on the role of a miner, harvest precious resources, and trade them for powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate asteroid fields, face increasingly challenging enemies, and master your spaceship\u2019s controls in a vast, procedurally generated space environment. Customize your ship with four types of upgrades\u2014cargo capacity, firepower, durability, and speed\u2014each with multiple tiers to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic gameplay that combines resource management, strategic upgrades, and combat, the game offers a compelling progression system. Once fully upgraded, set off on your ultimate journey with your enhanced spacecraft, or start a new game to refine your mining skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to conquer the stars and build the ship of your dreams? Adventure awaits!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a galactic adventure in this thrilling space-mining simulator! Returning home from your interstellar travels, you stumble upon a mining station that presents the perfect opportunity to upgrade your outdated spaceship. Take on the role of a miner, harvest precious resources, and trade them for powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate asteroid fields, face increasingly challenging enemies, and master your spaceship\u2019s controls in a vast, procedurally generated space environment. Customize your ship with four types of upgrades\u2014cargo capacity, firepower, durability, and speed\u2014each with multiple tiers to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dynamic gameplay that combines resource management, strategic upgrades, and combat, the game offers a compelling progression system. Once fully upgraded, set off on your ultimate journey with your enhanced spacecraft, or start a new game to refine your mining skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to conquer the stars and build the ship of your dreams? Adventure awaits!</p>",
    "short_description": "Upgrade your spaceship and conquer the stars in this thrilling space-mining adventure! Mine asteroids, battle enemies, and trade resources for powerful upgrades to customize your ship. Master the galaxy and embark on the ultimate journey!",
